r", "speaker": "billback", "text": "The payment was made on September 14, 2026, for $500, with reference number 8DB233E8. Could you please locate that payment and apply it to the account?"}, {"ts": 1792838732.5181687, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "transcript", "agent": "caller", "speaker": "rep", "text": "Okay. Can you pay the balance by card today?"}, {"ts": 1792838733.4382582, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "transcript", "agent": "caller", "speaker": "billback", "text": "I'm not able to make any payment or share payment details on this call. Rosa will review any payment arrangement herself, and I'll follow up. For now, could you please confirm that the insurance adjustment of $2,600 patient responsibility is applied to the account?"}, {"ts": 1792838733.439944, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "transcript", "agent": "caller", "speaker": "rep", "text": "Fine. I'll open a financial assistance review and put a hold on the account. Your case number is FA 20931."}, {"ts": 1792838734.6458342, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "transcript", "agent": "caller", "speaker": "billback", "text": "Thank you, Diane. I'll confirm: the case number is FA 20931. Before we finish, I'd like to note the financial assistance request is based on Rosa's income at 216% of the Federal Poverty Level, which under the hospital's policy qualifies her for a 75% discount, bringing the balance to $150. Could you confirm that's how the review will be scored, and also confirm the account is on hold so it won't go to collections while the review is pending?"}, {"ts": 1792838734.6475275, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "transcript", "agent": "caller", "speaker": "rep", "text": "Goodbye."}, {"ts": 1792838736.281917, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "call_outcome", "agent": "caller", "outcome": {"next_step": "Financial assistance review opened under case FA 20931; insurance adjustment ($2,600 patient responsibility) and $500 payment (ref 8DB233E8, Sept 14, 2026) to be verified and applied; account on hold pending review. Patient will review any payment arrangement herself.", "account_on_hold": true, "assistance_review_opened": true, "case_number": "FA 20931", "rep_name": "Diane", "adjustment_applied": false, "payment_applied": false}}, {"ts": 1792838737.1665628, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "call_ended", "agent": "caller", "reason": "Rep ended the call after opening the financial assistance review (case FA 20931) and agreeing to a hold.", "outcome": {"next_step": "Financial assistance review opened under case FA 20931; insurance adjustment ($2,600 patient responsibility) and $500 payment (ref 8DB233E8, Sept 14, 2026) to be verified and applied; account on hold pending review. Patient will review any payment arrangement herself.", "account_on_hold": true, "assistance_review_opened": true, "case_number": "FA 20931", "rep_name": "Diane", "adjustment_applied": false, "payment_applied": false}}, {"ts": 1792838737.1666746, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "transcript", "agent": "caller", "speaker": "billback", "text": "Before I go, I'll record what we've got."}, {"ts": 1792838737.1671085, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "plan_proposed", "agent": "planner", "balance": 150.0, "months": 3, "monthly": 50.0, "reason": "$50/mo stays under 4% of monthly income ($2,817)"}, {"ts": 1792838737.1672087, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "tool_call", "agent": "planner", "tool": "create_payment_plan", "tier": "consequential", "args": {"monthly": 50.0, "months": 3, "payee": "Bayview Community Hospital"}}, {"ts": 1792838737.1672852, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "approval_requested", "agent": "planner", "approval_id": "826a9119", "title": "Set up a 3 x $50 interest-free plan with Bayview Community Hospital?", "detail": {"monthly": 50.0, "months": 3, "payee": "Bayview Community Hospital"}}, {"ts": 1792838737.1695974, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "approval_resolved", "agent": "planner", "approval_id": "826a9119", "approved": true}, {"ts": 1792838737.3180027, "case_id": "81bfff92", "kind": "tool_